WEBVTT

00:02:28.544 --> 00:02:32.114
and where it will take us,
and how excited we should be about it,

00:02:32.138 --> 00:02:33.796
how worried we should be about it,

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.836
what we might do with
that excitement and those worries.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:38.780
A good place to start, Kai-Fu, would be:

00:02:38.804 --> 00:02:41.237
you have said
that artificial intelligence,

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:46.293
that we should think of it as
a sort of an epoch-changing invention,

00:02:46.317 --> 00:02:50.749
along the lines of
the steam engine and electricity.

00:02:50.773 --> 00:02:52.696
Why do you make that case?

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:55.510
KFL: I think we've only had
a very small number

00:02:55.534 --> 00:03:00.955
of truly groundbreaking technologies
that impact every part of our lives,